<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Lord Hollick joins Village board.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Lord Hollick joins Village board.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cinema, theme park and radio group Village Roadshow Ltd said on Friday it had appointed Lord Clive Hollick as director the group.</p>
<p>Hollick is chief executive of British media group United News and Media Plc, which owns about 17 percent of Village.</p>
<p>Village share closed two cents down at A$4.41.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
